<title>BELGIUM: EU economy expected to pick up in 97, 98.</title>
<headline>EU economy expected to pick up in 97, 98.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Thursday it expected the European Union (EU) economy to pick up in 1997 and 1998 but unemployment would remain high.</p>
<p>&quot;Based on sound monetary and budgetary policies, a recovery in economic growth is underway in the community,&quot; it said in a report on the EU economy.</p>
<p>&quot;Output growth is expected to pick up to around trend rate in 1997 and above its trend in 1998. Union-wide unemployment is expected to decline in 1997 and 1998, but the level will remain high,&quot; it added. -- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
